	"resource type Handle = builtin(\"close_handle\")\n\nunion IOError:\n\tOther(String)\n\ntrait Readable:\n\tfunc read_text(handle: Self) -> Result[String, IOError]\n\nfunc open_handle(path: String) -> Result[Handle, IOError]:\n\tbuiltin(\"open_handle\")\n\nimplements Readable for Handle:\n\t@resource_result_ordinary\n\tfunc read_text(handle: Handle) -> Result[String, IOError]:\n\t\tbuiltin(\"read_handle\")"


